      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Luke at Green Incentives was very helpful, answered all my question, educated me about how to choose the best solar option for my site and power use. I had many misconceptions and misinformation that I had picked up. Luke gave me the calculations he based his opinions and recommendation on. Provided all documentation that I requested. My wife said the Installer tradie arrived on the right day, started on time, after installing the system, demonstrated the system working and answered her questions in a friendly manner. Luke followed up with after sales service (how to turn on the system after connection to grid). Allowed me to make 3 payments to complete the deal.Just received first bill from Origin. I am very happy with the result.",
